# Dashbots bar. This file is ~/.config/dashbots/config
#
# swingMs is one full swing, right then left, in milliseconds. Lower is faster.
# animate is true or false. false keeps a working icon still.
# place is center-right, center-left, left, or right.
#   center-right: just to the right of the weather.
#   center-left: just to the left of the clock and weather.
#   left: just to the right of the workspace listing.
#   right: just to the right of the tray.
# icons is a folder under ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/dashbots/icons.
#   botvaders is the default. primitives is the other shipped set.
#   An SVG added to that folder becomes an icon. A new folder is a new set.
#   A new session picks one icon from that set. An icon already showing
#   is skipped until every icon in the set is on the bar.
#   Saving a different set moves the marks that are already up onto it.
#
# Install rewrites this file from the current template and keeps the values below.
#
# Saving this file applies the values. The bar layout reloads on its own.
# If a change does not show, run: omarchy restart shell

swingMs 2000
animate true
place center-right
icons botvaders
